  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Blazing Courage — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, while your technique may be simple, that does not mean it isn’t powerful. While holding a melee weapon you can spend 10 ce as an action to swing your weapon, creating a 30 feet cone of intense flame and heat. All creatures within range must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d12 fire damage and being knocked prone on a failed save or half as much on a successful save. <br />\n If a creature fails by 5 or more, they gain severe burns and take additional fire damage equal to your proficiency bonus from any source of fire damage until they finish a long rest.</p>",
